<title>JAPAN: Tokyo bourse says seeks to list Tohoku Misawa.</title>
<headline>Tokyo bourse says seeks to list Tohoku Misawa.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Monday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry to list shares of Tohoku Misawa Homes Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Tohoku Misawa Homes is likely to be listed on September 11 and plans to issue one million new shares and to sell 200,000 shares already issued, the TSE said.</p>
<p>Tohoku Misawa Homes, now traded on the over-the-counter (OTC) market, is a construction firm affiliated with Misawa Homes Co Ltd, a major builder of wooden prefabricated houses.</p>
